# Dirgur Nemesis (Megamorph {6}{U}): cast face down (a Black Lotus pays the {3}), it is turned face up for exactly {6}{U} (CR 702.37e, 116.2b) as a special action: the pool is empty right after, so no more than {6}{U} was taken. Sources are laid so that the cost minus one mana, and the full count with a colored pip unmet, are each refused (the refusal is judged again with mana to spare), and the Moxen that pay are the generic filler plus one of each colored pip. Face up it is Dirgur Nemesis again, 6/5 with Defender, plus a +1/+1 counter from its megamorph cost (CR 702.37b).

